# ── PHI / governed-data guard. Read this before adding anything. ─────────────
# The underlying data are protected health information under IRB H-55929 and
# H-53771. Nothing patient-level may ever enter this repository. The aggregate
# Foundry export is ALSO excluded: it contains no patient rows, but some cells
# fall below a disclosure-safe count and one provenance note records internal
# identifiers, so it is governed alongside the source data.
#
# If you add a data loader, point it at a path OUTSIDE the repo. Do not "just for
# now" commit a CSV.

# Aggregate exports and any data dump
foundry_exports/
*.txt
!requirements*.txt
*.csv
*.tsv
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.parquet
*.feather
*.dta
*.sav
*.json
*.pkl
*.pickle
*.h5
*.hdf5
*.db
*.sqlite

# Notebooks — outputs routinely embed data previews
*.ipynb

# Manuscript sources and build artifacts
*.tex
*.bib
*.pdf
*.aux
*.log
*.bbl
*.blg
*.out
*.synctex.gz

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
env/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/

